msgid ""
"`SPEA2Comparator` (`sort_population` internally computes "
"$S(i)$/$R(i)$/$D(i)$/$F(i)$ via `spea2_fitness`)"
msgstr "`SPEA2Comparator`（`sort_population`内部で`spea2_fitness`が$S(i)$/$R(i)$/$D(i)$/$F(i)$を計算）"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:51
msgid "L2"
msgstr "手順 L2"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:51
msgid "Environmental selection"
msgstr "環境選択"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:51
msgid ""
"`SPEA2Comparator.sort_population()` + `TruncationSelection()` (uses "
"`spea2_truncation_order` for the non-dominated $F(i)<1$ block, ascending "
"$F(i)$ for the dominated $F(i)\\geq1$ block, and ascending `cv` for "
"infeasible solutions)"
msgstr ""
"`SPEA2Comparator.sort_population()` + "
"`TruncationSelection()`（$F(i)<1$の非劣解ブロックには`spea2_truncation_order`を適用し、$F(i)\\geq1$の劣解ブロックは$F(i)$昇順、実行不可能解は`cv`昇順とする）"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:51
msgid "L3"
msgstr "手順 L3"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:51
msgid "Evaluation strategy"
msgstr "評価戦略"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:51
msgid ""
"`DirectStrategy` (no surrogate involved; every candidate generated by "
"`GA.ask()` is evaluated with the true objective function)"
msgstr "`DirectStrategy`（サロゲートを介さず、`GA.ask()`が生成した候補を全て真の目的関数で評価する）"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:51
msgid "L2 (in-generation evaluation)"
msgstr "L2（世代内の評価）"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:109
msgid ""
"The `problem.comparator = SPEA2Comparator()` line cannot be omitted. In "
"NSGA-II, `NSGA2Comparator` is the default for `n_obj > 1`, so the same "
"line could be omitted, but this is not the case for SPEA2."
msgstr ""
"`problem.comparator = SPEA2Comparator()`の行は省略できません。 NSGA-"
"IIでは`NSGA2Comparator`が`n_obj > 1`のときの既定値なので同じ行を省略できましたが、SPEA2ではそうではありません。"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:112
msgid "Differences from the source"
msgstr "文献との差分"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:114
msgid ""
"The original SPEA2 specifies population size $N$ and archive size $\\bar "
"N$ independently, but saealib's `GA.tell()` combines the population and "
"offspring into one pool, so the same value is used for both."
msgstr ""
"SPEA2の原法は個体群サイズ$N$とアーカイブサイズ$\\bar "
"N$を独立に指定しますが、saealibの`GA.tell()`は個体群と子個体を一つのプールにまとめるため、両者に同じ値を使います。"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:116
msgid "Parameters and variants"
msgstr "パラメータと変種"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:118
msgid "Complexity"
msgstr "計算量"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:120
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Fitness computation ($S(i)$/$R(i)$/$D(i)$) is $O(M^2)$ ($M=N+\\bar N$), "
"or $O(M^2\\log M)$ including the distance sort needed for density "
"estimation. The truncation operator is $O(M^3)$ in the worst case and "
"$O(M^2\\log M)$ on average {cite}`zitzler2001spea2`."
msgstr ""
"適応度計算($S(i)$/$R(i)$/$D(i)$)は$O(M^2)$（$M=N+\\bar "
"N$）で、密度推定のための距離ソートを含めると$O(M^2\\log M)$になります。 "
"打ち切り演算子は最悪$O(M^3)$、平均では$O(M^2\\log M)$です{cite}`zitzler2001spea2`。"

#: ../../algorithms/spea2.md:123
msgid ""
"**Swapping the dominator (dominance predicate)**: "
"`SPEA2Comparator(dominator=...)` lets you inject a "
"[Dominator](../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md) other than the "
"default `ParetoDominator`. Since the computation of $S(i)$/$R(i)$ depends"
" on this dominance predicate, swapping it changes SPEA2's fitness itself."
msgstr "**支配述語の差し替え**：`SPEA2Comparator(dominator=...)`では、既定の`ParetoDominator`以外の[Dominator](../concepts/problem_and_ranking/dominance.md)を注入できます。$S(i)$/$R(i)$の計算はこの支配述語に依存するため、差し替えるとSPEA2の適応度自体が変わります。"

